/// Room object changes keyed by object id. Apply each entry in order (official client `U`/`N`): `null` removes the held object; an id the client does not hold carries a complete `RoomObject`, which the client adds; for a held object the value is a `RoomObjectPatch`: first convert every top-level array property of both the held object and the patch into an object keyed by array index, then deep-merge the patch into the held object with lodash 3 `_.merge` semantics, except that an array merged into an array replaces it. A property set to `null` means the property was removed or cleared. The first event after subscribing holds every object of the room; later events hold only changes since the previous event delivered to this connection.
pub type RoomObjectsDiff = serde_json::Map<String, serde_json::Value>;

